  user_input {
    user_response: "Here is the complete content architecture to adapt your \"Z\303\241hrada na mieru\" (Custom Garden) template into the DESMO STAV construction website.By keeping the structural bones of your template and simply swapping the assets and text, you can maintain a high-end UI while perfectly fitting the construction niche.1. Global Design System Updates (The \"Construction\" Look)To shift the template from a landscaping vibe to a premium construction feel, update your CSS variables to these core colors:Primary Backgrounds (Dark Mode): Charcoal Black (#111111 or #1A1A1A) \342\200\223 Replaces dark greens/earth tones to convey solidity, modern architecture, and trust.Accent Color (Buttons, Icons, Highlights): Safety Gold / Warm Yellow (#D4AF37 or #E5A93B) \342\200\223 Replaces bright greens. It acts as a subtle nod to construction equipment while looking premium.Secondary Backgrounds: Crisp White (#FFFFFF) and Light Grey (#F5F5F5) for clean contrast in text-heavy sections.Typography: Keep a clean, geometric sans-serif (like Montserrat, Inter, or Poppins).2. Template Content Mapping (Section by Section)Here is the exact 1-to-1 content replacement for the sections typically found in a landscaping/service template.Section 1: Hero (\303\232vodn\303\241 sekcia)Template Element: Large garden background image.DESMO STAV Replacement: Full-width image of a modern, finished family house with warm interior lighting. Apply a 60% dark overlay.Headline (H1): Stavby, ktor\303\251 maj\303\272 z\303\241klad v kvalite.Subtitle (H2): Zrealizujeme v\303\241m b\303\275vanie od prvej my\305\241lienky a\305\276 po odovzdanie k\304\276\303\272\304\215ov. Kompletn\303\251 stavebn\303\251 rie\305\241enia od z\303\241kladov a\305\276 po fin\303\241lne detaily pre Bratislavu a okolie.Primary CTA Button: NEZ\303\201V\303\204ZN\303\201 CENOV\303\201 PONUKASecondary CTA Button / Link: \360\237\223\236 +421 907 673 697Section 2: Trust Strip (P\303\241s d\303\264very)Template Element: Icons like \"Eco-friendly,\" \"Fast planting.\"DESMO STAV Replacement: 4 horizontal icons.\360\237\233\241\357\270\217 Kvalita na prvom mieste: Poctiv\303\241 pr\303\241ca so z\303\241rukou.\360\237\221\267 Sk\303\272sen\303\275 t\303\255m: Odborn\303\255ci s dlhoro\304\215nou praxou.\360\237\223\205 Dodr\305\276iavame term\303\255ny: Va\305\241a stavba odovzdan\303\241 na\304\215as.\360\237\244\235 F\303\251rov\303\275 pr\303\255stup: Transparentn\303\251 ceny bez skryt\303\275ch poplatkov.Section 3: Main Services Grid (Na\305\241e Slu\305\276by)Template Element: Cards for \"Lawn Care\", \"Tree Planting\", etc.DESMO STAV Replacement: 4 main pillars (Use icons or small thumbnail images for each card).Card 1: Stavby na k\304\276\303\272\304\215Popis: Kompletn\303\241 v\303\275stavba rodinn\303\275ch domov od z\303\241kladovej dosky a\305\276 po odovzdanie. Hrub\303\241 stavba, strechy a in\305\276inierske siete.Card 2: Rekon\305\241trukciePopis: Kompletn\303\251 rekon\305\241trukcie domov a bytov vr\303\241tane prer\303\241bky bytov\303\275ch jadier a k\303\272pe\304\276n\303\255 na k\304\276\303\272\304\215.Card 3: Exteri\303\251r a Fas\303\241dyPopis: Zatep\304\276ovanie budov, fas\303\241dne \303\272pravy, zemn\303\251 a v\303\275kopov\303\251 pr\303\241ce, pokl\303\241dka dla\305\276by a ter\303\251nne \303\272pravy.Card 4: Interi\303\251r a In\305\241tal\303\241ciePopis: Voda, kanaliz\303\241cia, k\303\272renie, elektroin\305\241tal\303\241cie, sadrokart\303\263ny, \305\241tukov\303\251 omietky a maliarske pr\303\241ce.Link under each card: ZOBRAZI\305\244 VIAC \342\236\224Section 4: Process Timeline (Ako prebieha spolupr\303\241ca)Template Element: Steps like \"Design -> Soil Prep -> Planting.\"DESMO STAV Replacement: 4 clear steps (Horizontal or Vertical list).01 Obhliadka a konzult\303\241cia: Pr\303\255deme na miesto, vypo\304\215ujeme si va\305\241e predstavy a zhodnot\303\255me stav.02 N\303\241vrh a cenov\303\241 ponuka: Priprav\303\255me v\303\241m transparentn\303\275 rozpo\304\215et a jasn\303\275 harmonogram pr\303\241c.03 Realiz\303\241cia: Za\304\215neme stava\305\245 alebo rekon\305\241truova\305\245 pod\304\276a dohodnut\303\251ho pl\303\241nu s d\303\264razom na \304\215istotu a kvalitu.04 Odovzdanie a servis: Hotov\303\251 dielo v\303\241m odovzd\303\241me pripraven\303\251 na u\305\276\303\255vanie. T\303\275m v\305\241ak na\305\241a starostlivos\305\245 nekon\304\215\303\255.Section 5: Portfolio / Gallery (Na\305\241e realiz\303\241cie)Template Element: Masonry grid or slider of garden photos.DESMO STAV Replacement: Swipeable slider of high-quality construction projects.Pre-fill with placeholder titles: \"Rodinn\303\275 dom \342\200\223 Z\303\241horsk\303\241 Bystrica\", \"Rekon\305\241trukcia bytu \342\200\223 Ru\305\276inov\", \"Fas\303\241da a exteri\303\251r \342\200\223 Dev\303\255nska Nov\303\241 Ves\".Button below slider: ZOBRAZI\305\244 VIAC REALIZ\303\201CI\303\215 \342\236\224Section 6: Testimonials (Referencie klientov)Template Element: Reviews about beautiful lawns.DESMO STAV Replacement: Swipeable review cards.Review 1: \342\200\236Profesion\303\241lny pr\303\255stup od za\304\215iatku do konca. V\305\241etko prebehlo pod\304\276a dohody a v\303\275sledok je skvel\303\275.\342\200\234 \342\200\223 Martin K.Review 2: \342\200\236Rekon\305\241trukcia k\303\272pe\304\276ne dopadla lep\305\241ie, ako sme \304\215akali. \304\214ist\303\241 pr\303\241ca, odpor\303\272\304\215am ka\305\276d\303\251mu.\342\200\234 \342\200\223 Lucia B.Section 7: Pre-Footer CTA (Z\303\241vere\304\215n\303\241 v\303\275zva)Template Element: \"Ready for a new garden?\"DESMO STAV Replacement: Full-width dark block with gold text/buttons.Headline: M\303\241te projekt? Porozpr\303\241vajme sa o \305\210om.Subtext: Priprav\303\255me v\303\241m nez\303\241v\303\244zn\303\272 cenov\303\272 ponuku a navrhneme najlep\305\241ie rie\305\241enie pre va\305\241e b\303\275vanie.Button: NEZ\303\201V\303\204ZN\303\201 CENOV\303\201 PONUKA \342\236\224Section 8: Footer (P\303\244ti\304\215ka)Left Column (O firme):DESMO STAV, spol. s r.o.Kompletn\303\251 stavebn\303\251 rie\305\241enia od z\303\241kladov a\305\276 po fin\303\241lne detaily. Poctiv\303\241 pr\303\241ca, na ktor\303\272 sme hrd\303\255.Middle Column (R\303\275chle odkazy): \303\232vod, Slu\305\276by, Realiz\303\241cie, O n\303\241s, KontaktRight Column (Kontakt):\360\237\223\215 Krajinsk\303\241 30, 821 06 Bratislava\360\237\223\236 +421 907 673 697\342\234\211\357\270\217 info@desmostav.skFacebook | Instagram (Social Icons)"
    items {
      text: "Here is the complete content architecture to adapt your \"Z\303\241hrada na mieru\" (Custom Garden) template into the DESMO STAV construction website.By keeping the structural bones of your template and simply swapping the assets and text, you can maintain a high-end UI while perfectly fitting the construction niche.1. Global Design System Updates (The \"Construction\" Look)To shift the template from a landscaping vibe to a premium construction feel, update your CSS variables to these core colors:Primary Backgrounds (Dark Mode): Charcoal Black (#111111 or #1A1A1A) \342\200\223 Replaces dark greens/earth tones to convey solidity, modern architecture, and trust.Accent Color (Buttons, Icons, Highlights): Safety Gold / Warm Yellow (#D4AF37 or #E5A93B) \342\200\223 Replaces bright greens. It acts as a subtle nod to construction equipment while looking premium.Secondary Backgrounds: Crisp White (#FFFFFF) and Light Grey (#F5F5F5) for clean contrast in text-heavy sections.Typography: Keep a clean, geometric sans-serif (like Montserrat, Inter, or Poppins).2. Template Content Mapping (Section by Section)Here is the exact 1-to-1 content replacement for the sections typically found in a landscaping/service template.Section 1: Hero (\303\232vodn\303\241 sekcia)Template Element: Large garden background image.DESMO STAV Replacement: Full-width image of a modern, finished family house with warm interior lighting. Apply a 60% dark overlay.Headline (H1): Stavby, ktor\303\251 maj\303\272 z\303\241klad v kvalite.Subtitle (H2): Zrealizujeme v\303\241m b\303\275vanie od prvej my\305\241lienky a\305\276 po odovzdanie k\304\276\303\272\304\215ov. Kompletn\303\251 stavebn\303\251 rie\305\241enia od z\303\241kladov a\305\276 po fin\303\241lne detaily pre Bratislavu a okolie.Primary CTA Button: NEZ\303\201V\303\204ZN\303\201 CENOV\303\201 PONUKASecondary CTA Button / Link: \360\237\223\236 +421 907 673 697Section 2: Trust Strip (P\303\241s d\303\264very)Template Element: Icons like \"Eco-friendly,\" \"Fast planting.\"DESMO STAV Replacement: 4 horizontal icons.\360\237\233\241\357\270\217 Kvalita na prvom mieste: Poctiv\303\241 pr\303\241ca so z\303\241rukou.\360\237\221\267 Sk\303\272sen\303\275 t\303\255m: Odborn\303\255ci s dlhoro\304\215nou praxou.\360\237\223\205 Dodr\305\276iavame term\303\255ny: Va\305\241a stavba odovzdan\303\241 na\304\215as.\360\237\244\235 F\303\251rov\303\275 pr\303\255stup: Transparentn\303\251 ceny bez skryt\303\275ch poplatkov.Section 3: Main Services Grid (Na\305\241e Slu\305\276by)Template Element: Cards for \"Lawn Care\", \"Tree Planting\", etc.DESMO STAV Replacement: 4 main pillars (Use icons or small thumbnail images for each card).Card 1: Stavby na k\304\276\303\272\304\215Popis: Kompletn\303\241 v\303\275stavba rodinn\303\275ch domov od z\303\241kladovej dosky a\305\276 po odovzdanie. Hrub\303\241 stavba, strechy a in\305\276inierske siete.Card 2: Rekon\305\241trukciePopis: Kompletn\303\251 rekon\305\241trukcie domov a bytov vr\303\241tane prer\303\241bky bytov\303\275ch jadier a k\303\272pe\304\276n\303\255 na k\304\276\303\272\304\215.Card 3: Exteri\303\251r a Fas\303\241dyPopis: Zatep\304\276ovanie budov, fas\303\241dne \303\272pravy, zemn\303\251 a v\303\275kopov\303\251 pr\303\241ce, pokl\303\241dka dla\305\276by a ter\303\251nne \303\272pravy.Card 4: Interi\303\251r a In\305\241tal\303\241ciePopis: Voda, kanaliz\303\241cia, k\303\272renie, elektroin\305\241tal\303\241cie, sadrokart\303\263ny, \305\241tukov\303\251 omietky a maliarske pr\303\241ce.Link under each card: ZOBRAZI\305\244 VIAC \342\236\224Section 4: Process Timeline (Ako prebieha spolupr\303\241ca)Template Element: Steps like \"Design -> Soil Prep -> Planting.\"DESMO STAV Replacement: 4 clear steps (Horizontal or Vertical list).01 Obhliadka a konzult\303\241cia: Pr\303\255deme na miesto, vypo\304\215ujeme si va\305\241e predstavy a zhodnot\303\255me stav.02 N\303\241vrh a cenov\303\241 ponuka: Priprav\303\255me v\303\241m transparentn\303\275 rozpo\304\215et a jasn\303\275 harmonogram pr\303\241c.03 Realiz\303\241cia: Za\304\215neme stava\305\245 alebo rekon\305\241truova\305\245 pod\304\276a dohodnut\303\251ho pl\303\241nu s d\303\264razom na \304\215istotu a kvalitu.04 Odovzdanie a servis: Hotov\303\251 dielo v\303\241m odovzd\303\241me pripraven\303\251 na u\305\276\303\255vanie. T\303\275m v\305\241ak na\305\241a starostlivos\305\245 nekon\304\215\303\255.Section 5: Portfolio / Gallery (Na\305\241e realiz\303\241cie)Template Element: Masonry grid or slider of garden photos.DESMO STAV Replacement: Swipeable slider of high-quality construction projects.Pre-fill with placeholder titles: \"Rodinn\303\275 dom \342\200\223 Z\303\241horsk\303\241 Bystrica\", \"Rekon\305\241trukcia bytu \342\200\223 Ru\305\276inov\", \"Fas\303\241da a exteri\303\251r \342\200\223 Dev\303\255nska Nov\303\241 Ves\".Button below slider: ZOBRAZI\305\244 VIAC REALIZ\303\201CI\303\215 \342\236\224Section 6: Testimonials (Referencie klientov)Template Element: Reviews about beautiful lawns.DESMO STAV Replacement: Swipeable review cards.Review 1: \342\200\236Profesion\303\241lny pr\303\255stup od za\304\215iatku do konca. V\305\241etko prebehlo pod\304\276a dohody a v\303\275sledok je skvel\303\275.\342\200\234 \342\200\223 Martin K.Review 2: \342\200\236Rekon\305\241trukcia k\303\272pe\304\276ne dopadla lep\305\241ie, ako sme \304\215akali. \304\214ist\303\241 pr\303\241ca, odpor\303\272\304\215am ka\305\276d\303\251mu.\342\200\234 \342\200\223 Lucia B.Section 7: Pre-Footer CTA (Z\303\241vere\304\215n\303\241 v\303\275zva)Template Element: \"Ready for a new garden?\"DESMO STAV Replacement: Full-width dark block with gold text/buttons.Headline: M\303\241te projekt? Porozpr\303\241vajme sa o \305\210om.Subtext: Priprav\303\255me v\303\241m nez\303\241v\303\244zn\303\272 cenov\303\272 ponuku a navrhneme najlep\305\241ie rie\305\241enie pre va\305\241e b\303\275vanie.Button: NEZ\303\201V\303\204ZN\303\201 CENOV\303\201 PONUKA \342\236\224Section 8: Footer (P\303\244ti\304\215ka)Left Column (O firme):DESMO STAV, spol. s r.o.Kompletn\303\251 stavebn\303\251 rie\305\241enia od z\303\241kladov a\305\276 po fin\303\241lne detaily. Poctiv\303\241 pr\303\241ca, na ktor\303\272 sme hrd\303\255.Middle Column (R\303\275chle odkazy): \303\232vod, Slu\305\276by, Realiz\303\241cie, O n\303\241s, KontaktRight Column (Kontakt):\360\237\223\215 Krajinsk\303\241 30, 821 06 Bratislava\360\237\223\236 +421 907 673 697\342\234\211\357\270\217 info@desmostav.skFacebook | Instagram (Social Icons)"
    }
  }
}
